Description: Current OnePlus Pad 2 Pro (erhai) kernel
 Depends on the selected versioned kernel payload. Each payload owns its
 matching signed boot images and module tree, so upgrades preserve the
 modules needed by the running and rollback kernels. Configuring this
 selector activates the matching boot triplet without restarting the device.
